	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『機動戦士ガンダム0080 ポケットの中の戦争』に登場したジム・コマンドのコロニー戦仕様をMG化。",
			"• 特徴的なコロニー仕様のランドセルを新規造形で再現。",
			"• MG準拠の新規造形でジム・コマンドの特徴的な機体形状を再現。",
			"• 腰部のスムーズな可動や、 腕や脚など人体に近い可動域を実現し、幅広い可動領域で様々なポージングが可能。",
			"• ブルパップ・マシンガンなどの武器が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• The Gym Commando colony battle specification that appeared in \"MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM 0080 War in the Pocket\" has been made into MG.",
			"• The characteristic colony specification school bag is reproduced with a new model.",
			"• Reproduce the characteristic fuselage shape of Jim Command with a new MG-compliant model.",
			"• Smooth movement of the waist and a range of motion close to the human body, such as arms and legs, are realized, and various poses can be performed in a wide range of motion."
		]
